## Executive Summary

Qwen3.8-Max is Alibaba's flagship general-purpose model from the Qwen 3.8 series, released in 2026, designed for complex reasoning, coding, and knowledge work. It features a massive 1M token context window, competitive pricing, and strong performance across agentic benchmarks. The model ranks 27th overall with a score of 89.8/100, indicating strong performance in the frontier model landscape. Qwen3.8-Max is part of the Qwen 3.8 series alongside Qwen3.8, Qwen3.8-flash, Qwen3.8-flash-next, Qwen3.8-flash-cyber, Qwen3.8-27b, and Qwen3.8-flash-lite, offering different capabilities and pricing tiers.

